    "checkout": {
      "note": "Who is still in the building. TwoTimTwo's /clubber/checkout page IS the live list of children currently checked in, so this event carries that set rather than a departure signal. Same data class as `checkin` (first name + club, never a last name or an allergy), and sealed by the same transport. IMPORTANT for consumers: this is derived from whether volunteers PERFORMED checkout, not from whether children actually left, so it can be confidently wrong during a pickup rush. It also identifies unattended children once a count gets small, so a consumer MUST gate it behind an operator setting and must stop naming individuals below a threshold. See SECURITY.md in the display repo.",
